Usage: serve [options]

Serves a model

Options:
  -p, --port INT      port [default: 8080] [min: 0, max: 65535]
      --threads INT   worker threads (at least one) [default: 1] [min: 1]
      --ctx INT       context size [default: 0]
      --stats on|off  print statistics [default: off]
      --dir DIR       model folder
  -h, --help          show this help
